hite house , the department of justice , nobody outside the f. b. i. family had any idea what i was about to say . i say that under oath , i stand by that . there was no coordination . ” brian fallon , a spokesman for mrs. clinton ’s presidential campaign , said in a statement that mr. comey ’s testimony “ clearly knocked down a number of false republican talking points . ” he added that “ while republicans may try to keep this issue alive , this hearing proved those efforts will only backfire . ”
