publicans , ” mr. borges recalled of a conversation he had with mr. trump . “ he asked , ‘ is that because of me ? ’ ” “ i told him yes , ” he said . what he did not say is that many republican primary voters came out to vote against mr. trump , who received nearly 36 percent of the vote in the contest , which mr. kasich won . “ you do n’t have a movement without trump , ” mr. borges said .
